{"name": "In My Bubble \u2022\u00b0", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save dreams from the all-devouring shadows in a world that can no longer sleep.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One sheep\u2026 two sheep\u2026 people used to drift off counting sheep. But the sheep who delivered dreams have been stolen by a shadow that devours the world. As people stop falling asleep, the world loses its balance. Nightmares awaken, and the Dream Factory falls silent. Now you must purify the shadow-stained sheep and restart the broken chain of dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with a little lamb who escaped the nightmare\u2014and bring back a dazzling morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"730\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.poster.avif?t=1784345063\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.webm?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.mp4?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Blow, Pop, and Bounce!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.poster.avif?t=1784345063\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.webm?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.mp4?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.poster.avif?t=1784345063\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.webm?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.mp4?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield your mysterious Bubble Stick to fight corrupted sheep and nightmares. Cleanse them with a flashy Bubble Dash, turning them back into dream couriers once more.\u00a0Bubbles are both powerful weapons and springy platforms. Create, ride, and pop bubbles to cross gaps, climb terrain, and move freely through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Dazzling Morning After the Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Defeat towering bosses and return warm sunlight to the world. Thanks to your courage, people will finally fall asleep again\u2014and wake up to a bright, lively morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.poster.avif?t=1784345063\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.webm?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/extras/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.mp4?t=1784345063\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In My Bubble is a 3D action-adventure platformer featuring a child in a cute earflap hat on a quest to save the sheep of the dream world. Explore a world overtaken by darkness, rescue corrupted sheep, and restore the lost morning using the power of bubbles!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270630/e33cc23a0d7f05bbbcd567e61f7ecfcec973582a/header.jpg?t=1784345063", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Collectathon", "Platformer", "3D", "Cute", "Controller"], "developers": "Juicy House", "publishers": "Juicy House", "release_date": "Feb 4, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4270630", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 February 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/50FLI_EFNfA", "first_seen": 1770249600.0, "review_rank": 1261}